           "html": "<p>Learn how the Irish originally helped American settlements and how it still affects American culture, with a focus on:  Ulster Men and Women Emigrate to Colonies (c. 1750)-The Famine and Mass Emigration (c.1860-1900)-The Irish and the Towns (New York, Boston, Chicago)-“From Shanty to Lace Curtains”-The Irish Join the Middle Classes-The Irish Contributions to the United States-Famous Irish Men and Women.</p>"
